  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss6:2.3.7": "The nuns’ offenses entailing suspension 7, 8, and 9 are identical to <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss5/en/brahmali#2.2.13.1'>Bu Ss 5:2.2.13.1</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss8/en/brahmali#1.9.32.1'>Bu Ss 8:1.9.32.1</a>, and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9/en/brahmali#1.2.14.1'>Bu Ss 9:1.2.14.1</a> respectively. "
